      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit a video file with Vidu S2-Editing. It takes no prompt: each segment's reference image and edit type steer it. The first segment restyles the clip after the anime image, the second dresses her in the sequined jacket, and the third recasts her as the marble statue. Each segment holds its edit for its frames; a switch takes a few seconds to show in the output, so give each segment several seconds.\n\nVidu S2-Editing prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/vidu-s2-editing/prompt-guide\n\nOnly the first segment's video is used. The clip is a LongLive-2.0 render from this plugin. Copy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Edit a video file with Vidu S2-Editing. It takes no prompt: each segment's reference image and edit type steer it. The first segment restyles the clip after the anime image, the second dresses her in the samurai armour, and the third recasts her as the marble statue. Each segment holds its edit for its frames; a switch takes a few seconds to show in the output, so give each segment several seconds.\n\nOnly the first segment's video is used. The clip is a LongLive-2.0 render from this plugin. Copy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
